{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:59:57+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-11T16:59:57+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Nokian Renkaat Oyj","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"Finland","city":"Nokia","website":"https://www.nokiantyres.com","employees":4277,"summary":"Nokian Renkaat Oyj develops and manufactures tires for passenger cars, trucks, and heavy machineries in Nordics, Central Europe, North America, and internationally. It operates through Passenger Car Tyres; Heavy Tyres; and Vianor segments. The company develops and produces winter, summer, and all-season tires for passenger cars, SUVs, and vans; tires for forestry machinery; tires for ports and terminals, mining, agriculture, trucks and buses, earthmoving, and road maintenance. It also sells car, truck, buse, and van tires under the Nokian Tyres and other tire brands; other automotive products and services; provide car maintenance and tire service; and operates Vianor service centers. The company distributes its products through Vianor chain, Vianor Partner chain, Nokian Tyres Authorized Dealers network, as well as through tire dealers, car dealerships, and vehicle manufacturers, and online stores. Nokian Renkaat Oyj was founded in 1898 and is headquartered in Nokia, Finland.","exchange":"Helsinki","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Nokian Renkaat Oyj développe et fabrique des pneus pour les voitures particulières, les camions et les machines lourdes dans les pays nordiques, en Europe centrale, en Amérique du Nord et à l'international. Il opère par le biais de pneus pour voitures de tourisme, de pneus lourds et de segments Vianor. L'entreprise développe et produit des pneus d'hiver, d'été et toutes saisons pour les voitures de tourisme, les VUS et les fourgonnettes; des pneus pour les machines forestières; des pneus pour les ports et les terminaux,